  "description": "Work is done, fun begins. Meet the Rossignol After Hours Deore 12 e-MTB, your all-access pass to flowy trails, good times and unforgettable sunsets.\n\nFrom smooth climbs to fluid descents, the Bosch Performance Line CX motor and our tailor-made aluminum frame deliver responsive power and an intuitive ride that keeps you in the flow. The four-bar linkage design with RockShox suspension offering 150 mm of rear travel and 160 mm up front delivers confident control and agile handling in rough terrain.\n\nThe Shimano Deore 12-speed drivetrain and SRAM DB8 hydraulic brakes offer consistent shifting and control.\n\nClock out, and turn up the fun.\n\nReliable Power and Versatile Range\nDominate every ascent with the Bosch Performance Line CX motor, providing class-leading torque and fluid assistance. Paired with the 600Wh PowerTube battery, it offers a lightweight and balanced setup for riders who want peak motor performance with agile handling for all-day trail adventures\n\nIntuitive Control Remote\nKeep it simple and focused with the Bosch LED Remote. This streamlined interface provides at-a-glance information about your assist mode and battery level, allowing you to stay focused on the trail while easily managing your power settings\n\nRobust RockShox Suspension\nThe RockShox Domain Gold Isolator R fork brings big-bike performance with its stiff 38mm chassis and 160 mm of travel, while the RockShox Deluxe Select+ rear shock provides 150 mm of travel with a proven air spring for a plush, predictable feel on any terrain\n\nPrecise 12-Speed Shifting\nThe Shimano Deore 12-speed drivetrain delivers smooth and dependable gear changes. Known for its \"workhorse\" reliability, it provides a wide gear range to tackle steep inclines and fast descents with confidence\n\nConsistent Mineral Oil Braking\nSRAM DB8 hydraulic brakes offer powerful, low-maintenance braking performance. Using a mineral oil system and four-piston calipers, they provide the reliable heat management and modulation needed for the extra speed and weight of an e-MTB.\n\nDurable Trail-Ready Wheels\nEngineered for durability, the wheelset is built to handle the extra torque of the Bosch motor and the rigors of aggressive riding, ensuring you can focus on picking your line through the most challenging sections.",
